  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific Islands Chiefs of Police Secretariat 2021-2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity provides core financial support to Pacific Islands Chiefs of Police Secretariat. PICP has 21 member countries, and is an important mechanism for information sharing and supporting members on&#xa0;regional initiatives to strengthen Pacific policing and regional security.
The funding will be delivered through a three year MOU with New&#xa0;Zealand Police, who host the PICP Secretariat.</narrative>
  </description>
